      "writtenOn": "2023-12-15T09:46:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is enabling the old behavior only if the flag is true.\nYou are doing a reverse flagging here.\nshould it be:\n\n\n```suggestion\n  if (IS_FLAG_ENABLED_TRUE_ON_FLOSS(l2cap_tx_complete_cb_info)) {\n  // Activate new code if the flag is true (aka new code on floss)\n    l2cap_ret \u003d L2CA_SendFixedChnlData(fixed_cid, rem_bda, p_toL2CAP);\n    if (l2cap_ret \u003d\u003d L2CAP_DW_FAILED) {\n      LOG_ERROR(\"SMP failed to pass msg to L2CAP\");\n      return false;\n    } else {\n      tSMP_CB* p_cb \u003d \u0026smp_cb;\n\n      if (p_cb-\u003ewait_for_authorization_complete) {\n        tSMP_INT_DATA smp_int_data;\n        smp_int_data.status \u003d SMP_SUCCESS;\n        if (fixed_cid \u003d\u003d L2CAP_SMP_CID) {\n          smp_sm_event(p_cb, SMP_AUTH_CMPL_EVT, \u0026smp_int_data);\n        } else {\n          smp_br_state_machine_event(p_cb, SMP_BR_AUTH_CMPL_EVT, \u0026smp_int_data);\n        }\n      }\n      return true;\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // when the flag is false, we still trigger the old code\n  \n  smp_cb.total_tx_unacked +\u003d 1;\n  l2cap_ret \u003d L2CA_SendFixedChnlData(fixed_cid, rem_bda, p_toL2CAP);\n  if (l2cap_ret \u003d\u003d L2CAP_DW_FAILED) {\n    LOG_ERROR(\"SMP failed to pass msg to L2CAP\");\n    smp_cb.total_tx_unacked -\u003d 1;\n    return false;\n  } else {\n    return true;\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAnd because you are returning in all the error case, please change the else to not be an else and remove an indentation level.\nIf I take my above suggestion, the code become:\n\n```\n  if (IS_FLAG_ENABLED_TRUE_ON_FLOSS(l2cap_tx_complete_cb_info)) {\n    l2cap_ret \u003d L2CA_SendFixedChnlData(fixed_cid, rem_bda, p_toL2CAP);\n    if (l2cap_ret \u003d\u003d L2CAP_DW_FAILED) {\n      LOG_ERROR(\"SMP failed to pass msg to L2CAP\");\n      return false;\n    }\n    tSMP_CB* p_cb \u003d \u0026smp_cb;\n\n    if (p_cb-\u003ewait_for_authorization_complete) {\n      tSMP_INT_DATA smp_int_data;\n      smp_int_data.status \u003d SMP_SUCCESS;\n      if (fixed_cid \u003d\u003d L2CAP_SMP_CID) {\n        smp_sm_event(p_cb, SMP_AUTH_CMPL_EVT, \u0026smp_int_data);\n      } else {\n        smp_br_state_machine_event(p_cb, SMP_BR_AUTH_CMPL_EVT, \u0026smp_int_data);\n      }\n    }\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  smp_cb.total_tx_unacked +\u003d 1;\n  l2cap_ret \u003d L2CA_SendFixedChnlData(fixed_cid, rem_bda, p_toL2CAP);\n  if (l2cap_ret \u003d\u003d L2CAP_DW_FAILED) {\n    LOG_ERROR(\"SMP failed to pass msg to L2CAP\");\n    smp_cb.total_tx_unacked -\u003d 1;\n    return false;\n  }\n  return true;\n}\n```",
